  function payRateDialog(data){return `<dialog id="native-pay-rate-dialog" class="native-dialog"><form method="dialog"><button class="native-dialog-close" value="cancel" aria-label="Tutup">×</button></form><p class="eyebrow">Payroll preview</p><h3 id="native-pay-rate-title">Atur tarif</h3><p>Tarif hanya dipakai untuk estimasi dan disalin ke jadwal yang dipublish setelah perubahan. Tidak ada pembayaran atau potongan otomatis.</p><form id="native-pay-rate-form" class="native-form"><input type="hidden" name="staffId"><input type="hidden" name="expectedUpdatedAt"><label>Dasar tarif<select name="rateType" required><option value="per_shift">Per shift</option><option value="per_hour">Per jam kerja</option></select></label><label>Nominal rupiah<input type="number" name="amountRupiah" min="1" max="100000000" step="1" required inputmode="numeric"></label><button class="button button-primary">Simpan tarif preview</button></form></dialog>`;}
