    return `<dialog id="native-roster-rules-dialog" class="native-dialog native-dialog-roster native-roster-rules" aria-labelledby="native-roster-rules-title"><form method="dialog"><button class="native-dialog-close" value="cancel" aria-label="Tutup">×</button></form><div class="native-dialog-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Aturan jadwal</p><h3 id="native-roster-rules-title">Edit aturan jadwal</h3><p>Pilih pola, hari libur, kapasitas shift, dan rolling. Kalender tetap menjadi tampilan utama dashboard.</p></div><span class="native-status ${impossible?'native-status-warning':'native-status-active'}">${impossible?'Perlu disesuaikan':'Siap dipakai'}</span></div><div class="native-rule-settings"><label>Pola jadwal<select id="native-roster-pattern">${rosterPatterns.map(([id,name])=>`<option value="${id}" ${rules.patternId===id?'selected':''}>${name}</option>`).join('')}</select><small>${escape(rosterPatterns.find(([id])=>id===rules.patternId)?.[2]||'Aturan khusus bulan ini.')}</small></label><label>Rolling setiap<select id="native-rotation-block"><option value="1" ${rules.rotationBlockDays===1?'selected':''}>1 hari</option><option value="2" ${rules.rotationBlockDays===2?'selected':''}>2 hari</option><option value="3" ${rules.rotationBlockDays===3?'selected':''}>3 hari</option></select><small>Maksimal dua shift sejenis tetap diperiksa sebagai konflik.</small></label></div><p class="native-rule-summary"><strong>Hari libur:</strong> ${escape(allowed||'belum dipilih')} · <strong>Maks. libur terjadwal:</strong> 1 orang per hari · <strong>Jeda:</strong> ${rules.minimumRestHours} jam · <strong>Maks. shift sama:</strong> 2 hari · <strong>Maks. kerja:</strong> ${rules.maxConsecutiveDays} hari / ${rules.maxWeeklyHours} jam per minggu${set!=='auto'?` · <strong>Set terakhir:</strong> ${escape(set)}`:''}</p><p class="native-rule-note">Set A–D dipilih setiap kali menekan Generate. Izin, sakit, dan cuti darurat tetap mengikuti persetujuan Owner.</p>${impossible?'<p class="native-rule-warning">Jumlah minimum shift melebihi staf yang tersedia setelah libur. Turunkan minimum atau gunakan pola Tim aktual.</p>':''}<div class="native-rule-table-wrap" role="region" tabindex="0" aria-label="Aturan kapasitas jadwal"><table class="native-rule-table"><thead><tr><th>Hari</th><th>Boleh libur</th>${templates.map(template=>`<th>${escape(template.name)}<small>${escape(template.startTime)}–${escape(template.endTime)}</small></th>`).join('')}</tr></thead><tbody>${dayRows}</tbody></table></div><div class="native-rule-actions"><p>Simpan aturan bulan ini. Pilihan Set dilakukan terpisah saat generate.</p><button class="button button-primary" type="button" data-roster-save-rules>Simpan pengaturan jadwal</button></div></dialog>`;
